# The eval harness pipes the agent's reply into handoff.txt inside this working
# copy, and a --verify-tree gate rightly refuses to commit around an undeclared
# file. Ignored files do not appear in `git status --porcelain`, so this keeps
# the harness's own artifact out of the lane's tree check (run 1, 2026-09-03).
handoff.txt
node_modules/
